  <title mediaType="text/plain" representation="TXT">Portable Medical Orders</title>
  <text>
    <paragraph> This section includes minimal structured data. Refer to the Source Form Section for
      complete representation of the document. If additional discrete data is required, please
      contact the document Custodian. </paragraph>
    <table ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.1.medicalOrder">
      <colgroup>
