      </colgroup>
      <thead>
        <tr ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.orderType">
          <td align="left" colspan="5">
            <content styleCode="Bold">B. Initial Treatment Orders.</content>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="1">Order Precondition</td>
          <td colspan="1">Order Detail</td>
          <td colspan="1">Procedure</td>
          <td colspan="1">Goal</td>
          <td colspan="1">Note(s)</td>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td align="left" colspan="1"
            ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.orderPrecondition"
            >Follow these orders if <content
              ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.precondition1"
              >patient has a pulse and/or is breathing</content>.</td>
          <td align="left" colspan="1"
            ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.orderDetail">
            Comfort-focused treatments </td>
          <td align="left" colspan="1"
            ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.procedure">
            <content styleCode="Bold"
              ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.procedurePerform"
              >Perform </content>
            <content
              ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.procedureProcedure"
              >Comfort-focused Treatments</content>
          </td>
          <td align="left" colspan="1"
            ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.goal">Maximize comfort
            through symptom management; allow natural death.</td>
          <td align="left" colspan="1">
            <list ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.notes">
              <item ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.note1">
                <content styleCode="Italic">Use oxygen, suction and manual treatment of airway
                  obstruction as needed for comfort. Avoid treatments listed in full or select
                  treatments unless consistent with comfort goal. Transfer to hospital only if
                  comfort cannot be achieved in current setting.</content>
              </item>
            </list>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="left" colspan="5"
            ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.2.instruction1">
            <content styleCode="Italic">Reassess and discuss interventions with patient or patient
              representative regularly to ensure treatments are meeting patient’s care goals.
              Consider a time-trial of interventions based on goals and specific outcomes.</content>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
