          <td align="left" colspan="1"
            ID="e14539-1d5e9110a6a64c92976a69e4a60d7cda-1750106336.59772-4.4.orderDetail"> Trial
            period for artificial nutrition but no surgically-placed tubes </td>
          <td align="left" colspan="1"
